# Nix develop for Node tooling

`node` and `npm` are not on the default PATH. Run them through the project flake:

```bash
nix develop -c node ...
nix develop -c npm ...
```

Examples:

```bash
nix develop -c node src/example.ts
nix develop -c npm install
```

Do not call bare `node` / `npm` in shells outside `nix develop`.
